{"overview":{"Symbol":"JBS","Name":"JBS N.V.","Description":"JBS N.V., together with its subsidiaries, engages in the processing of animal proteins, encompassing activities related to beef, pork, lamb, and poultry worldwide. The company is involved in the production and marketing of prepared foods and other related products, as well as operations in leather, collagen, hygiene and beauty products, metal packaging, biodiesel, and other related businesses. It offers its products under the Seara, Doriana, Pilgrim's, Moy Park, Primo, Friboi, Maturatta, Swift, Ozo, Adaptable Meals, and other brand names. The company was founded in 1953 and is based in Amstelveen, the Netherlands.","CIK":"","Exchange":"NYSE","Currency":"USD","Country":"Netherlands","Sector":"Consumer Defensive","Industry":"Packaged Foods","Address":"Stroombaan 16, Amstelveen, 1181 VX, Netherlands","FiscalYearEnd":"","LatestQuarter":"","MarketCapitalization":"12973673472","EBITDA":"5898439168","PERatio":"7.478395","PEGRatio":"","BookValue":"7.688","DividendPerShare":"1.34","DividendYield":"0.1116","EPS":"1.62","RevenuePerShareTTM":"82.607","ProfitMargin":"0.01977","OperatingMarginTTM":"0.02368","ReturnOnAssetsTTM":"0.056020003","ReturnOnEquityTTM":"0.22102","RevenueTTM":"88266285056","GrossProfitTTM":"10999317504","DilutedEPSTTM":"1.62","QuarterlyEarningsGrowthYOY":"-0.559","QuarterlyRevenueGrowthYOY":"0.107","AnalystTargetPrice":"19.15512","TrailingPE":"7.478395","ForwardPE":"7.4954667","PriceToSalesRatioTTM":"0.14698334","PriceToBookRatio":"1.5758324","EVToRevenue":"0.393","EVToEBITDA":"5.886","Beta":"","52WeekHigh":"18.65","52WeekLow":"11.49","50DayMovingAverage":"15.3312","200DayMovingAverage":"14.9191","SharesOutstanding":"776034596","DividendDate":"","ExDividendDate":"","DebtToEquity":"268.232"},"daily":{"Meta Data":{"1. Information":"Daily Time Series (Yahoo Finance, shaped like Alpha Vantage)","2. Symbol":"JBS","3. Last Refreshed":"2026-10-16","4. Output Size":"Compact"},"Time Series (Daily)":{"2026